BSdyIv_MjYPjbDF3DLcB6Dpfr8OgyvFzEGs1g_IxHcHObGBHYM5Z2HVPkD5LEBpgaqoIAOpXipRYLNBRmIyZ8s1vleiV7TPS9aMIyIs2ZLayTH_qnjjh5GzC7xyfdRY_PPVqMyMcf0Qo_yrBdDPzqiL0qpBDibl3RFq_7657C5xaaDQqNRegMphsbzrR-uzaKLO2wecnWJyJeJD8xGOTBBtzfkyF4oPRJmnGX08-eLlA91ZD7mVhjMqZPCboQaKlSVnKhs4XthmBjjHZvU7SvzhRa1u972B1EKQsVMBHOpB3GmMCznwTD_8IkOy-rLJRVDSiHn1MnUaWozqXS-zEWBBTo2rRjrDtJ32azm6K-U5eWCd8JOa7WSScwSQCVTs8doAdpFS9Xg6bxTyiqLajLwv5pEhxn6eEzsWeBk7CDXun62voDGnJz8qlpUl0_RvXQvz6wOslg7M/vk7C6V7exin6zlqlHrNumxWHV2KIc6yi/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="特朗普盟友赢得哥伦比亚大选，预示着亲市场的转变"&gt;对犯罪采取零容忍态度&lt;/a&gt;赢得了哥伦比亚总统职位。这一承诺将从第一天起就受到考验。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;这是一个早期的提醒，在哥伦比亚和整个拉丁美洲，恢复秩序&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/coT2dxP42wgc8c3NQoi1pINn5RupkXfFToAPrpD7dXDf0BWTBbWAMbw8LxVuxF772cDT_ybAAN15vNzDeFVDY2tkVMNFS1iNszO8U9KnDkCO45XtQqIELwidk4TfNZUDe_D_LRMxAAl4K4P525sVyRRIWr2v6TVUjqvMCBK2AI5KuJLFBT1kaax21MpQ4eaootBunGehU_bPVuIWfSVY5BTWvominDuftif3W5BN_SOdHbEYiyymkn-bFbp9uXi-9KlIo3vg0jD_0OxR2EkW3rxrNxaU5M2EXBNodXd7AW0RR6Wkrnt48jnI2arYBM1weTkxWX9d_3NHXkkwDN8ryuAjYUbdQSn-gV71ZGKHbotuf4-kDBzjHRParnfkwJH72VFhPfSPg9AvggvCEkmFDQpQtgjDvON7C-6qA4qsSQS8aEADFthdXeKGX8muXh3mou923tEqC4TH1Jq9qXhpNjNlbS5ytYhySd6v3tanmJgh__c9GASbAOboBn1oGPrJkTAeuDEfaKn8WaMuuYLDiLTgVfWJQaOH5xTnbG9VZK7Zt4K8ptx1TwOQgi4zlz8/NQRcq5cuBfdWKWtSQDBBFh3X3j2l19Ji/23" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="哥伦比亚新​​总统加入右翼浪潮，面对严峻的现实"&gt;比承诺更容易实现&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;德拉埃斯普里埃拉在上任之前就面临着一系列挑战。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;其中包括即将卸任的总统古斯塔沃·佩特罗的欺诈指控、被击败的左翼竞争对手伊万·塞佩达发起的抗议活动，以及&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/KlYPehxAD__AFp37upHYItT_ZIC8oQIhCTYnOzgtJbYiul_Uxax1rFB42XCZOaf9yAcAc--9Pfu-hWvTtx7imknTfIT-yiS0fJRLZJ-ks4Z8rkVAyCzQnXZVi0-8JGVbOV95_N1Rp-fX-wGnFnQXxLONi1xVpQ_rtDaFzfgaWVEioUmD41itZSOP-saM7FRrZ7