: 16px;"&gt;此后市场环境有所改善，为新发行铺平了道路。此外，非常慷慨的溢价帮助推动了对该交易的需求，推动 Alphabet 自 2025 年初以来的债务发行量超过 1140 亿美元，并再次使其成为同期人工智能相关债券的最大卖家。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;figure style="margin: 20px 0;"&gt; &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/JZgja1zEGypa73zISPvCHOrLqSC2DwFOQZMIAA4JrGdka8y63t6Bj7T88udjSJOt4G1_yhf95M9iTUOVXoBXEha6T4kpxv9w5UeUsv1vxS6qzyll3BW68Fu3-gk0dSCfIYnMD04KJEv1FZvtpoI6BAD5kMq6L-3R13KJlsAuZEskfMzFFN9ugn3uLQ8qQuYY0Oab_9rjlyydooDi6DzFv0riRb2LKDRrshPfdhQKu69owvYQ3POxLHMvpwhKdzZteVvIwVR94-g9vuIQIup2eiUgHpKYb_acLoBWR1EoDllGltqX1oEFiM3h-HKn0-sWfakR5gp8d3KZK2eMXv3Tx7pz9ww6Si9COGTDPWHuTp_Nqex3_mOLcdVVetC-foWQNoi9YbIvZGT2lKYA3abDx6zxm9-GIlhjkl9Ind9_NFwrTgMU2EMxKxNJZm1EEdhe7c8xaMNlq7-SabAMD5ySpBDV141WqqDJYQlw3HEH2xfo1WU7nSQCdRz7tletq3tzK7vtZTO760CPgK8vTJIt/5Nq8IqhiUMInUAFcFqVbVP0JbUGiSXyq/23" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/if5PJHgAbkSo/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" alt="" width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="替代" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/if5PJHgAbkSo/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/figure&gt;&lt;hr style="border-top: 1px solid; margin-top: 24px;" /&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;英国首相马克·卡尼表示，特朗普对外国铝征收的关税&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/dNxtC4OVqPCf3UWPDvTSsFYzxpsDwhnpjfUvegBtCc8Xizx0WigtIsjY_Fm8fbDy21Xgnux0GaAfECW5TrXQwE5iGcpeqlxxjUslheC-asVOqx0ebrIWhQ_u9VrOiVjgHTVRw2JspII-Zt3o9tkklk-u0K8P85J2abhpwu_4I66vzkcgFh3Cek0GNTT6xtGdJNPDFU2pPUe_Rq0yJNU9SHqWugMFKE5xn0hOIT8dJEM9dePKhKRmyssoFWFa8ag3rmu1PbGyas45-fwsOaZ7q8e6lvzdf1ViPCNtS-Zhksm4ZZE7W9Kus4miGSE